Launch a debugging session

Identify the target run with exactly one of `run_id` (preferred) or `session_id`.

Example:
  debug {"run_id": "9043254f65c9c65d63fe043a0abfc7fc-53-1", "input_hash": "6057726200491963783", "vtime": 329.8037810830865, "title": "stalled leader election", "description": "debug this moment", "recipients": "team@example.com"}

Extra parameters can be passed with `param`. A `param` cannot replace the value of a dedicated param, such as `title`:
  debug {"run_id": "<run_id>", "input_hash": "<hash>", "vtime": <vtime>, "param": ["attrs.team=payments"]}

The response prints as one JSON object.
